        "detailed_description": "Traveler Arena is a lightly action-oriented roguelike adventure game set in a fictional gladiator world. Players will扮演 gladiators, continuously battling through a three-layer arena, experiencing rich randomness and replayability. Interact with enemies through the assault system, utilize treasure combinations to build unique and powerful builds, and enjoy the thrill of sweeping the battlefield once fully formed. Every choice will affect your growth path—challenge the limits and become a legendary gladiator!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063190/extras/24f2a372276f0c1b8f7486ff79439490.webp?t=1763218319\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063190/extras/b6e3e0b29afc38b0918af7eec894ced8.poster.avif?t=1763218319\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063190/extras/b6e3e0b29afc38b0918af7eec894ced8.webm?t=1763218319\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063190/extras/b6e3e0b29afc38b0918af7eec894ced8.mp4?t=1763218319\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>After unbalancing an enemy, you can launch a dash to deal significant damage and knock down energy orbs. Collecting these orbs fills your ultimate ability gauge, creating a combat rhythm of continuous offense and resource cycling that is simple to operate yet strategic.</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3063190/extras/99394133b38369fba6bb0c3346c9df97.webp?t=1763218319\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline post